  ($q$ei-474$q$, $q$rw$q$, $q$Expression of Ideas$q$, $q$Transitions$q$, 1, $q$Critics praised the film's cinematography. ______ audiences found the plot confusing.$q$, $q$Which choice completes the text with the most logical transition?$q$, $q$["Furthermore,","Similarly,","In contrast,","Subsequently,"]$q$::jsonb, 2, $q$The second sentence expresses contrast relative to the first sentence, so "In contrast" is the logical transition. The other choices signal relationships the sentences do not have.$q$),
  ($q$ei-475$q$, $q$rw$q$, $q$Expression of Ideas$q$, $q$Rhetorical Synthesis$q$, 2, $q$A student has gathered the following notes:
