  ($q$ei-483$q$, $q$rw$q$, $q$Expression of Ideas$q$, $q$Transitions$q$, 2, $q$Researchers first sequenced the plant's genome in 2004. ______ in 2017 they identified the gene responsible for its drought tolerance.$q$, $q$Which choice completes the text with the most logical transition?$q$, $q$["Therefore,","Later,","Specifically,","Nevertheless,"]$q$::jsonb, 1, $q$The second sentence expresses a sequence of events relative to the first sentence, so "Later" is the logical transition. The other choices signal relationships the sentences do not have.$q$),
  ($q$ei-484$q$, $q$rw$q$, $q$Expression of Ideas$q$, $q$Transitions$q$, 2, $q$Urban planners are experimenting with ways to reduce traffic. ______ some cities have introduced congestion fees for drivers entering downtown.$q$, $q$Which choice completes the text with the most logical transition?$q$, $q$["Consequently,","Nevertheless,","Specifically,","In addition,"]$q$::jsonb, 2, $q$The second sentence expresses a specific example relative to the first sentence, so "Specifically" is the logical transition. The other choices signal relationships the sentences do not have.$q$),
  ($q$ei-485$q$, $q$rw$q$, $q$Expression of Ideas$q$, $q$Rhetorical Synthesis$q$, 2, $q$A student has gathered the following notes:
