  ($q$ei-498$q$, $q$rw$q$, $q$Expression of Ideas$q$, $q$Transitions$q$, 1, $q$Tidal energy is highly predictable. ______ it produces no greenhouse gases during operation.$q$, $q$Which choice completes the text with the most logical transition?$q$, $q$["Therefore,","For example,","Afterward,","Furthermore,"]$q$::jsonb, 3, $q$The second sentence expresses an additional, supporting point relative to the first sentence, so "Furthermore" is the logical transition. The other choices signal relationships the sentences do not have.$q$),
