  ($q$ei-503$q$, $q$rw$q$, $q$Expression of Ideas$q$, $q$Transitions$q$, 2, $q$The first prototype of the electric ferry cost twice its projected budget. ______ the second prototype came in under budget.$q$, $q$Which choice completes the text with the most logical transition?$q$, $q$["For instance,","Nevertheless,","As a result,","Furthermore,"]$q$::jsonb, 1, $q$The second sentence expresses contrast relative to the first sentence, so "Nevertheless" is the logical transition. The other choices signal relationships the sentences do not have.$q$),
  ($q$ei-504$q$, $q$rw$q$, $q$Expression of Ideas$q$, $q$Rhetorical Synthesis$q$, 2, $q$A student has gathered the following notes:
