  ($q$ei-505$q$, $q$rw$q$, $q$Expression of Ideas$q$, $q$Transitions$q$, 1, $q$The novelist's early books sold only modestly. ______ her final novel became an international bestseller.$q$, $q$Which choice completes the text with the most logical transition?$q$, $q$["As a result,","For example,","Similarly,","On the other hand,"]$q$::jsonb, 3, $q$The second sentence expresses contrast relative to the first sentence, so "On the other hand" is the logical transition. The other choices signal relationships the sentences do not have.$q$),
  ($q$ei-506$q$, $q$rw$q$, $q$Expression of Ideas$q$, $q$Rhetorical Synthesis$q$, 2, $q$A student has gathered the following notes:
