  ($q$ei-525$q$, $q$rw$q$, $q$Expression of Ideas$q$, $q$Transitions$q$, 2, $q$Several everyday foods were first developed by accident. ______ potato chips originated when a chef tried to satisfy a complaining customer.$q$, $q$Which choice completes the text with the most logical transition?$q$, $q$["Similarly,","Thus,","Moreover,","For example,"]$q$::jsonb, 3, $q$The second sentence expresses a specific example relative to the first sentence, so "For example" is the logical transition. The other choices signal relationships the sentences do not have.$q$),
  ($q$ei-526$q$, $q$rw$q$, $q$Expression of Ideas$q$, $q$Rhetorical Synthesis$q$, 2, $q$A student has gathered the following notes:
