  ($q$ei-528$q$, $q$rw$q$, $q$Expression of Ideas$q$, $q$Transitions$q$, 1, $q$Mia forgot to renew her library card. ______ she could not borrow the book she needed.$q$, $q$Which choice completes the text with the most logical transition?$q$, $q$["For example,","Later,","Consequently,","Nevertheless,"]$q$::jsonb, 2, $q$The second sentence expresses a cause-and-effect result relative to the first sentence, so "Consequently" is the logical transition. The other choices signal relationships the sentences do not have.$q$),
  ($q$ei-529$q$, $q$rw$q$, $q$Expression of Ideas$q$, $q$Rhetorical Synthesis$q$, 2, $q$A student has gathered the following notes:
