  ($q$ei-534$q$, $q$rw$q$, $q$Expression of Ideas$q$, $q$Transitions$q$, 1, $q$Maya forgot her umbrella. ______ she arrived at work soaked from the rain.$q$, $q$Which choice completes the text with the most logical transition?$q$, $q$["For instance,","Similarly,","As a result,","However,"]$q$::jsonb, 2, $q$Arriving soaked is the consequence of forgetting the umbrella.$q$),
