  ($q$ei-538$q$, $q$rw$q$, $q$Expression of Ideas$q$, $q$Transitions$q$, 1, $q$The new phone is lighter than the old model. ______ its battery lasts longer.$q$, $q$Which choice completes the text with the most logical transition?$q$, $q$["In contrast,","Otherwise,","Moreover,","However,"]$q$::jsonb, 2, $q$The battery is an additional advantage.$q$),
