  ($q$ei-540$q$, $q$rw$q$, $q$Expression of Ideas$q$, $q$Transitions$q$, 1, $q$The town's water supply was contaminated. ______ officials told residents to boil all water before drinking it.$q$, $q$Which choice completes the text with the most logical transition?$q$, $q$["Therefore,","Likewise,","Otherwise,","However,"]$q$::jsonb, 0, $q$The advice is a response to the contamination.$q$),
