  ($q$ei-542$q$, $q$rw$q$, $q$Expression of Ideas$q$, $q$Transitions$q$, 1, $q$The library was closed for renovations. ______ patrons used the community center's reading room.$q$, $q$Which choice completes the text with the most logical transition?$q$, $q$["In contrast,","Nevertheless,","Meanwhile,","Specifically,"]$q$::jsonb, 2, $q$'Meanwhile' links the simultaneous activity.$q$),
